rule: RR1 — COLUMNS apply 가 쓰는 결과 식 셀의 ast 는 JSON 객체다(원문에 "ast":" 없음)
file: src/backend/mdm/lib/src/main/java/com/dongkuk/dmes/mdm/dme/ruleEdit/service/RuleColumnsService.java
test: cd src/backend && JAVA_HOME=/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home ./gradlew :mdm:api:test --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dme.ruleEdit.RuleColumnsServiceTest" --console=plain
e2e: no
--- find
                    exprs.put(finalIds.get(line), Map.of("expr", line.req.expr(), "ast", line.exprAst));
--- replace
                    exprs.put(finalIds.get(line), Map.of("expr", line.req.expr(), "ast", (Object) DomainJson.write(line.exprAst)));
